# The website reads its settings from the ONE shared .env in the project root
# (see ../.env.example). Nothing to configure here.
#
# Only if you develop the website on its own (npm run dev), export these in your shell:
#   BOT_API_BASE_URL  DASHBOARD_API_KEY  DISCORD_CLIENT_ID  DISCORD_CLIENT_SECRET
#   DASHBOARD_SESSION_SECRET  PUBLIC_URL  ADMIN_DISCORD_IDS  ENABLE_DEMO_DATA
